            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-desc.png",
            "content": "<p>Brisa cores are replaceable aroma cores for the Brisa sensory habit device — food-grade aroma compounds that recreate throat sensation, cooling and bold flavour. Snap a core in, twist your airflow, and reach for it in the moment you’d normally reach for the old habit. No nicotine, no vapour, no smoke.</p>"
