            "icon_style": "ingredients",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-ingred.png",
            "content": "<p>Each core is packed with food-grade aroma compounds — the same kind used in premium scent and sensory products for decades — layered with a real cooling compound that creates that crisp, cool sensation at the back of the throat. No nicotine, no vapour, no smoke, no combustion. Each core lasts 2–3 days.</p>"
          }
        },
