        "acc_special": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes brisa cores so special?",
            "icon_style": "special",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-desc.png",
            "content": "<p>Most alternatives only give you something to hold. Brisa cores recreate the parts that made the ritual satisfying — throat hit, cooling and bold flavour — from food-grade aroma alone. That’s the part everyone tries to copy, and no one’s cracked.</p>"
